<Box if={view.dialog} className="overlay-back">
  <Box className="paper-dialog">
    <Box className="dialog-top"><Text className="dialog-title">{view.settings ? "Room adjustments" : (view.gallery ? "The afternoon scrapbook" : (view.help ? "An extremely small manual" : "The ducks are on a break."))}</Text><Button className="ink-button quiet-button" ariaLabel="Close and return to the room, Escape" @click={closeOverlay}>×</Button></Box>
    <Box if={view.paused}>
      <Box className="pause-art"><Image loading="eager" src={asset("assets/art/tea.svg")} width="100%" height="100%" objectFit="contain" showPlaceholder={false} alt="A cup of tea" /></Box>
      <Text className="dialog-copy">{view.autoPaused ? "The room paused when you stepped away. Nobody pressed anything behind your back." : "All construction, constitutional crises and extremely important waiting are paused."}</Text>
      <Box className="dialog-buttons"><Button className="ink-button button-teal" @click={closeOverlay}>BACK TO THE DUCK</Button><Button className="ink-button" @click={openSettings}>SETTINGS</Button><Button className="ink-button" @click={openHelp}>HOW THIS WORKS</Button><Button className="ink-button quiet-button" @click={openGallery}>SCRAPBOOK</Button></Box>
    </Box>
    <Box if={view.settings}>
      <Box className="setting-row"><Box><Text className="setting-label">Small noises</Text><Text className="setting-note">Squeaks, quacks, machinery. M also works.</Text></Box><Button className="ink-button" @click={toggleSound}>{view.soundLabel}</Button></Box>
      <Box className="setting-row"><Box><Text className="setting-label">Volume</Text><Text className="setting-note">Quiet / comfortable / enthusiastic.</Text></Box><Button className="ink-button" @click={cycleVolume}>{view.volumeLabel}</Button></Box>
      <Box className="setting-row"><Box><Text className="setting-label">Room ambience</Text><Text className="setting-note">Background atmosphere, not another soundtrack.</Text></Box><Button className="ink-button" @click={toggleAmbience}>{view.ambienceLabel}</Button></Box>
      <Box className="setting-row"><Box><Text className="setting-label">Movement</Text><Text className="setting-note">Reduced removes shaking, wobbling and drifting.</Text></Box><Button className="ink-button" @click={toggleMotion}>{view.motionLabel}</Button></Box>
      <Box className="setting-row"><Box><Text className="setting-label">A helpful duck</Text><Text className="setting-note">Stationary chase targets and immediate help. All endings remain available.</Text></Box><Button className="ink-button" @click={toggleAssist}>{view.assistLabel}</Button></Box>
      <Box className="setting-row"><Box><Text className="setting-label">Narrator captions</Text><Text className="setting-note">Interaction labels always stay visible.</Text></Box><Button className="ink-button" @click={toggleCaptions}>{view.captionsLabel}</Button></Box>
      <Text className="save-note">{view.saveStatus}</Text>
      <Box if={!view.confirmingReset} className="dialog-buttons"><Button className="ink-button" @click={requestReset("room")}>RESET THIS ROOM</Button><Button className="ink-button quiet-button" @click={requestReset("all")}>ERASE ALL PROGRESS</Button></Box>
      <Box if={view.confirmingReset} className="reset-confirm"><Text className="setting-label">{view.resetPrompt}</Text><Text className="dialog-copy">{view.resetDetail}</Text><Box className="dialog-buttons"><Button className="ink-button button-red" @click={confirmReset}>YES, START FRESH</Button><Button className="ink-button" @click={cancelReset}>KEEP THE DUCKS</Button></Box></Box>
    </Box>
    <Box if={view.help}>
      <Text className="dialog-copy">There is a duck on a red button. The room has made its position very clear. What happens next is your responsibility.</Text>
      <Text className="dialog-copy">Tap or click the duck. Space also presses it. When a small complication arrives, tap the objects in the room or use their numbered keys. Tab moves between buttons; Enter activates the focused one.</Text>
      <Text className="dialog-copy">Nobody loses. Wrong guesses cost nothing. The room never needs fast reflexes. A LITTLE HELP reveals a hint, and LET A DUCK HANDLE IT resolves the current complication without losing an ending.</Text>
      <Text className="dialog-copy">Escape or P pauses. M changes sound. Your room and scrapbook save on this device. Time stops while paused or away. Animations are decorations, not timers you must beat.</Text>
      <Text className="save-note">Sound begins after your first interaction. You can enable it with the music button without pressing the duck.</Text>
      <Button className="ink-button button-teal" @click={closeOverlay}>THAT SEEMS REASONABLE</Button>
    </Box>
    <Box if={view.gallery}>
      <Text className="dialog-copy">{view.collectionLabel + " afternoons filed. Different decisions leave different souvenirs."}</Text>
      <Box className="scrapbook">
        #each (e in collection)
        <Box className={e.className}><Text className="smallprint">{e.seal}</Text><Text className="scrap-title">{e.title}</Text></Box>
        #end
      </Box>
      <Text if={view.legacyLabel} className="save-note">{view.legacyLabel}</Text>
      <Box className="dialog-buttons"><Button className="ink-button button-teal" @click={closeOverlay}>BACK TO THIS AFTERNOON</Button><Button className="ink-button" @click={requestReset("room")}>A FRESH ROOM</Button></Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
</Box>
